.SS "uint32_t schultz_event::source"
What moved the pointer: SCHULTZ_POINTER_MOUSE or SCHULTZ_POINTER_TOUCH\&. A finger and a mouse produce the same events, and a widget that wants to treat them differently has nothing else to tell them apart by\&. 
